# Roots for the Excel oracle — see ExcelOracleTests.
#
# Paths only. The workbooks are teaching material and employer models; they are
# private and none of them is in this repository. Recorded here for the same
# reason `.quality-gate.yml` records `consistency.corpusPath`: so nobody has to
# rediscover where they live.
#
# Not in `.quality-gate.yml` because that file is the gate binary's own schema and
# rejects keys it does not know — "advisory in this release and will become an
# error". A config file with an owner is not a config file to borrow.
#
# One path per line. `BUSINESSMATHEXCEL_CORPUS` overrides this;
# `BUSINESSMATHEXCEL_ORACLE=1` runs against it.
